### ===========================================
### Traffic Lights API Tests
### ===========================================

### GET all traffic lights - 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/traffic-lights
Accept: application/json

### GET single traffic light - 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/traffic-lights/1
Accept: application/json

### GET single traffic light - 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/traffic-lights/9999
Accept: application/json

### DELETE traffic light - 204 No Content
### WARNING: This will actually delete the traffic light!
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/traffic-lights/5
Accept: application/json

### DELETE non-existent traffic light - 404 Not Found
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/traffic-lights/9999
Accept: application/json

### ===========================================
### Intersections API Tests
### ===========================================

### GET traffic lights for intersection - 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/intersections/1/traffic-lights
Accept: application/json

### GET traffic lights for non-existent intersection - 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/intersections/9999/traffic-lights
Accept: application/json


